<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Zabbix · Входящие</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #0e141b;
            --bg-2: #151d27;
            --line: #243140;
            --text: #e7eef6;
            --muted: #8ea0b5;
            --sent: #3ddc97;
            --sent-bg: rgba(61, 220, 151, 0.12);
            --fail: #ff6b6b;
            --fail-bg: rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.12);
            --wait: #f5c16c;
            --wait-bg: rgba(245, 193, 108, 0.12);
            --accent: #6cb6ff;
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;
            color: var(--text);
            background:
                radial-gradient(1200px 500px at 10% -10%, rgba(108, 182, 255, 0.16), transparent 55%),
                radial-gradient(900px 400px at 100% 0%, rgba(61, 220, 151, 0.08), transparent 50%),
                var(--bg);
        }
        .wrap { max-width: 920px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 20px 64px; }
        header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; align-items: flex-end; margin-bottom: 22px; }
        .brand { display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: center; }
        .mark {
            width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 12px;
            display: grid; place-items: center;
            background: linear-gradient(160deg, #1d4e89, #16324f);
            border: 1px solid #2c6cb5;
            font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: #d7ebff;
        }
        h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 650; }
        .sub { margin: 4px 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
        .stats { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .stat {
            background: var(--bg-2); border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 999px; padding: 6px 12px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted);
        }
        .stat b { color: var(--text); font-weight: 650; }
        .list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
        article {
            background: rgba(21, 29, 39, 0.92);
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 16px 18px 14px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
        }
        .top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start; }
        .id { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
        h2 { margin: 2px 0 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 650; line-height: 1.35; }
        .pill {
            flex: none; border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px 10px;
            font-size: 12px; font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        }
        .sent { color: var(--sent); background: var(--sent-bg); }
        .failed { color: var(--fail); background: var(--fail-bg); }
        .pending { color: var(--wait); background: var(--wait-bg); }
        time { display: block; margin-top: 8px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
        pre {
            margin: 12px 0 0; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word;
            font-family: Consolas, "Cascadia Mono", ui-monospace, monospace;
            font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; color: #d5e2ef;
            background: #0c1218; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px;
            border: 1px solid #1c2836;
        }
        .empty {
            border: 1px dashed var(--line); border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 48px 20px; text-align: center; color: var(--muted);
            background: rgba(21, 29, 39, 0.55);
        }
        .empty strong { display: block; color: var(--text); font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
        code { color: var(--accent); }
        footer { margin-top: 22px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    {% set sent = 0 %}
    {% set failed = 0 %}
    {% for alert in alerts %}
        {% if alert.status == 'Sent' %}{% set sent = sent + 1 %}
        {% elseif alert.status starts with 'Failed' %}{% set failed = failed + 1 %}
        {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
    <div class="wrap">
        <header>
            <div class="brand">
                <div class="mark">ZB</div>
                <div>
                    <h1>Входящие</h1>
                    <p class="sub">Уведомления Zabbix и статус отправки в Telegram</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="stats">
                <div class="stat">всего <b>{{ alerts|length }}</b></div>
                <div class="stat">отправлено <b>{{ sent }}</b></div>
                <div class="stat">ошибки <b>{{ failed }}</b></div>
            </div>
        </header>

        {% if alerts is empty %}
            <div class="empty">
                <strong>Пока пусто</strong>
                Сюда попадут алерты после POST на <code>/webhook/zabbix</code>
            </div>
        {% else %}
            <div class="list">
                {% for alert in alerts %}
                    {% set status_class = alert.status == 'Sent' ? 'sent' : (alert.status starts with 'Failed' ? 'failed' : 'pending') %}
                    {% set label = alert.status == 'Sent' ? 'Отправлено' : (alert.status starts with 'Failed' ? 'Ошибка' : 'Ожидает') %}
                    <article>
                        <div class="top">
                            <div>
                                <div class="id">#{{ alert.id }}</div>
                                <h2>{{ alert.subject }}</h2>
                            </div>
                            <span class="pill {{ status_class }}" title="{{ alert.status }}">{{ label }}</span>
                        </div>
                        <time>{{ alert.receivedAt|date('d.m.Y H:i:s', 'UTC') }} UTC</time>
                        <pre>{{ alert.message }}</pre>
                    </article>
                {% endfor %}
            </div>
        {% endif %}
        <footer>Обнови страницу, чтобы увидеть новые события.</footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
